                                "sense_id": "144e794f-2868-3acd-86fe-885bb0f698a2",
                                "text": "Make use of fresh herbs and spices, squeezes of citrus juice and zest, and spare drizzlings of olive oil instead of flavoring your food with a lot of added fat, salt, or sugar."
